# polymarket-sdk-cpp

High-performance C++23 SDK for [Polymarket](https://polymarket.com) prediction markets.

[![CI](https://github.com/Wammero/polymarket-sdk-cpp/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/Wammero/polymarket-sdk-cpp/actions/workflows/ci.yml)
